h_0\\land q_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\\land\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Delta^*)]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\widehat\\delta_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Delta^*),\\qquad\\widehat\\delta_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\{(q,\\varepsilon)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\widehat\\delta_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Q\\times\\Delta^*),\\qquad\\widehat\\delta_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\{(q,\\varepsilon)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\widehat\\delta_M(q,wa)\\coloneqq\\{(r,z)\\in Q\\times\\Delta^*:\\exists p\\in Q\\;\\exists u,v\\in\\Delta^*\\;[z=uv\\land(p,u)\\in\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\land(r,v)\\in\\delta(p,a)]\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\widehat\\delta_M(q,wa)\\coloneqq\\{(r,z)\\in Q\\times\\Delta^*:\\exists p\\in Q\\;\\exists u,v\\in\\Delta^*\\;[z=uv\\land(p,u)\\in\\widehat\\delta_M(q,w)\\land(r,v)\\in\\delta(p,a)]\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nM(w)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Delta^*:\\exists p\\in F\\;(p,y)\\in\\widehat\\delta_M(q_0,w)\\},\\quad M[L]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{w\\in L}M(w),\\quad M^{-1}[K]\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:M(w)\\cap K\\ne\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\nM(w)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\Delta^*:\\exists p\\in F\\;(p,y)\\in\\widehat\\delta_M(q_0,w)\\},\\quad M[L]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{w\\in L}M(w),\\quad M^{-1}[K]\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:M(w)\\cap K\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NonerasingGSM}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall(p,u)\\in\\delta(q,a)\\;u\\ne\\varepsilon\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}sequential\\text{-}machine}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NonerasingGSM}(M)\\leftrightarrow\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\forall(p,u)\\in\\delta(q,a)\\;u\\ne\\varepsilon\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>原书 GSM 是非确定性的：一个转移可输出多个候选词，且可输出空词。每一步必须消耗一个输入字符，所以固定有限输入的输出集合有限。关系逆像表示存在一个输出属于 K，不要求 GSM 是单值或可逆。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Delta$ 是字母表，$M$ 为候选六元组；结构定义后的子句固定 $M=(Q,\\